Tested up to: 4.5.2
Stable tag: 1.0.0
License: GPL2 or later

Inspired by "Google Image Search (GIS)", this addon, when activated, will create a new layout for products on a store page.

== Description ==
This add-on for [iThemes Exchange](https://ithemes.com/exchange/ "iThemes Exchange") creates a "Google Image Search (GIS)" like layout for products on the store page. This layout will work best for pages with products that have featured images of the same size.

== Installation ==

1. Upload the folder 'exchange-addon-gis-layout' to the '/wp-content/plugins/' directory
2. Activate 'iThemes Exchange - GIS Layout' through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
3. Open the 'Addons' screen through the 'Exchange' menu in your WordPress dashboard
4. If GIS Layout Loop is not enabled, click Enable beside the 'GIS Layout' entry in the Addons listing
5. You can find settings for the addon via wp-dashboard > Exchange > Addons


